      <data key="d4">"Jaco M. Greeff has recently joined the faculty of Central South University, a prestigious national university in China."</data>
      <data key="d5">"new employment, current affiliation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0379</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACO M. GREEFF&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR WANG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Professor Wang, Dean of the School of Science at Central South University, welcomes Jaco M. Greeff to the team, highlighting his expertise and contributions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"welcome, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0379</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACO M. GREEFF&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR LI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Professor Li, a colleague and fellow researcher at Central South University, acknowledges Jaco M. Greeff's expertise and contributions to the scientific community."</data>
      <data key="d5">"acknowledgment, collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0379</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACO M. GREEFF&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR ZHANG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Professor Zhang, the President of Central South University, expresses confidence in Jaco M. Greeff's impact on the institution and its future success."</data>
      <data key="d5">"confidence, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0379</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF PRETORIA&quot;" target="&quot;CHANGSHA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The University of Pretoria is located in Pretoria, South Africa, while Central South University is in Changsha, China, indicating a geographical shift for Jaco M. Greeff."</data>
      <data key="d5">"geographical relocation, institutional change"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0379</data>
